# Keep the Docker context lean, but Python service images COPY from
# services/*/src, so the source trees must stay in the context — only
# the heavy artifacts are excluded (this was a regression: a blanket
# `services` exclusion broke `docker compose up --build`).
#
# User-created `.next.*-bak.*` backup directories MUST be excluded from the
# build context (never deleted) — a multi-GB backup in the context broke
# the legacy builder before it even reached the ignore evaluation.
.pnpm-store
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.next
.next.*-bak.*
.next.*-bak.*/
_sandbox
.tmp_research
docs/resume-brandagent-ai-pm.md
.clerk-ticket*.tmp
tests
docs/migrations
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/dist
**/build
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
.env*
*.log
